description:
The Royal Berkshire NHS Foundation Trust is seeking expressions of interest from organisations who are capable of and are interested in maintaining the Trust's Topcon ophthalmology assets. The assets are:
- Six (6) DRI OCT Triton Plus Retinal OCTs;
- One (1) 3D OCT-2000 3D Scanner;
- One (1) LM-8C Lensmeter; and
- One (1) KR 8900 Automated Ophthalmic Refractometer
The Trust is seeking a supplier for a multi-year contract preferably on fully comprehensive cover together with IT/Integration suppor
